     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{10\\;\\mathrm{mg}}{x\\;\\mathrm{tablets}}\"></span> (desired dose) \n<span data-math=\"=\\;\\frac{5\\;\\mathrm{mg}}{1\\;\\mathrm{tablet}}\"></span> (supply on hand) <br><span data-math=\"\\begin{aligned}5x&amp;=10\\;\\times1\\;\\\\x&amp;=\\frac{10}{5}\\\\x&amp;=2\\;\\mathrm{tablets}\\;\\mathrm{per}\\;\\mathrm{dose}.\\end{aligned}\"></span>"
